   "id": 645938,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "For questions 5 – 7, use the following information:\n<blockquote>\nA population of ants is 10,000 at the start of April. Since then, it triples each month.\n</blockquote>",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>At the start of April, there were 10,000 ants in the colony. How many ants will there be 1 month later?&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
